## Version 3.0.0

Breaking Changes

- Added compatibility with Optimizely CMS 13.
- Package targeting has moved to `net10.0` only. The previous `net8.0` target has been removed.
- Optimizely integration now targets CMS 13 packages and application-based APIs.
- Host resolution now uses the resolved application name, which changes the host identifier used when reading and writing stored feeds.

Changed

- `RssFeedDataController` now resolves feeds through `IApplicationResolver` and no longer depends on `IRequestHostResolver`.
- `OptimizelyRssFeedDiscoveryService` and `OptimizelySyndicationLinkService` now use application resolution APIs instead of the earlier site-definition flow.
- `RssFeedPartialRouter` now returns `null` for non-matching routes and uses span-based segment parsing.
- The Optimizely feed generation job now uses the CMS 13 `ScheduledJob` attribute.
- Added `CHANGELOG` to the solution items.

Build/Dependencies

- Updated Optimizely package references from the CMS 12 line to the CMS 13 line.
- Standardized on `System.ServiceModel.Syndication` `10.x`.
- Updated `GitVersion.MsBuild` to `6.6.0`.
- Updated `Azure.Storage.Blobs` to `12.13.1`.
- Updated the central `Azure.Identity` pin to `1.17.1`.
- Refreshed lock files to match the new package graph.
